==Trivia==
*In the [[Nyanko Daisensou|Japanese version]], this stage takes place in '''Hiroshima Prefecture'''.
*Hiroshima Prefecture's base consists of a [[wikipedia:Momiji manjū|momiji manjū]] pastry atop the gate of the [[wikipedia:Itsukushima Shrine|Itsukushima Shrine]], both signatures of Hiroshima Prefecture.

